      "title": "Privileged Access Management (PAM) - Britive",
      "summary": "Privileged access has expanded across humans, non-human identities, apps, and automation, creating visibility gaps, privilege sprawl, and usability friction. Modern PAM emphasizes discovery, vaulting and rotation of secrets, policy-based and context-aware authorization, JIT elevation, and session monitoring with analytics and ecosystem integrations. Britive spotlights a cloud-native Zero Standing Privilege model with runtime provisioning, continuous authorization signals, and controls for AI agents and MCP tool calls.",
